(6709679, 1004147, 108580, '<td valign="top">Like it a lot. No flashy DPC BS, just PJ at it''s most raw. Shows the underbelly of the city few see... Portrait orientation was maybe wrong for this expanse of industry. You also have a sensor dust bunny problem...which you can edit out in Adv. Editing rules.</td>', 'Like it a lot. No flashy DPC BS, just PJ at it''s most raw. Shows the underbelly of the city few see... Portrait orientation was maybe wrong for this expanse of industry. You also have a sensor dust bunny problem...which you can edit out in Adv. Editing rules.', '2012-03-14 09:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6709681, 1004467, 108580, '<td valign="top">Bold and beautiful entry. Not running with the pack, kudos.</td>', 'Bold and beautiful entry. Not running with the pack, kudos.', '2012-03-14 09:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6709682, 1004333, 113156, '<td valign="top">You got to love land plates, the touch of color really helps this.</td>', 'You got to love land plates, the touch of color really helps this.', '2012-03-14 09:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6709686, 1004197, 113156, '<td valign="top">Superbly done.</td>', 'Superbly done.', '2012-03-14 09:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6709693, 1004398, 113156, '<td valign="top">The sky''s the limit, or is it.</td>', 'The sky''s the limit, or is it.', '2012-03-14 09:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6709697, 1004095, 113156, '<td valign="top">Nice loose lead you''ve got there, I long for one of those, nice shot and superb title.</td>', 'Nice loose lead you''ve got there, I long for one of those, nice shot and superb title.', '2012-03-14 09:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6709714, 1004230, 145829, '<td valign="top">Out of focus/blurred</td>', 'Out of focus/blurred', '2012-03-14 10:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6709719, 1004359, 113156, '<td valign="top">Ha, that''s great, we are all flying through the universe, might as well do it comfortably.</td>', 'Ha, that''s great, we are all flying through the universe, might as well do it comfortably.', '2012-03-14 10:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6709725, 1004258, 138253, '<td valign="top">Great contrast of simple life vs big city. Tree branches take away from this image slightly in my opinion. still well done. Love the colours of the sun reflection in the water as the contrast to the ''dismal city'' look.</td>', 'Great contrast of simple life vs big city. Tree branches take away from this image slightly in my opinion. still well done. Love the colours of the sun reflection in the water as the contrast to the ''dismal city'' look.', '2012-03-14 10:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6709727, 1004138, 138253, '<td valign="top">Fascinating shot.</td>', 'Fascinating shot.', '2012-03-14 10:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6709728, 1004388, 138253, '<td valign="top">With the exception of four buildings on the horizon line it''s hard to tell this is supposed to be a city picture, looks more like a cool sunrise/sunset colour pic.</td>', 'With the exception of four buildings on the horizon line it''s hard to tell this is supposed to be a city picture, looks more like a cool sunrise/sunset colour pic.', '2012-03-14 10:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6709730, 1003046, 138253, '<td valign="top">Would prefer more city, less hill, in this picture given the challenge.</td>', 'Would prefer more city, less hill, in this picture given the challenge.', '2012-03-14 10:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6709731, 1003373, 138253, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Have to ask, did you use a card for setting your white balance, or just leave a long exposure for the city lights to come through ''as the eye sees it''? I''m guessing the title of the image has more to do with the duration of the exposure than how long it took you to walk to this vantage point :)</td>', 'Nice shot. Have to ask, did you use a card for setting your white balance, or just leave a long exposure for the city lights to come through ''as the eye sees it''? I''m guessing the title of the image has more to do with the duration of the exposure than how long it took you to walk to this vantage point :)', '2012-03-14 10:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6709733, 1003742, 138253, '<td valign="top">Ahh, Vegas. What a fantastically opulent city. Can''t wait to go back there and get some more images like this myself.</td>', 'Ahh, Vegas. What a fantastically opulent city. Can''t wait to go back there and get some more images like this myself.', '2012-03-14 10:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6709738, 1004460, 138253, '<td valign="top">Great colour and subject. This screams "Urban center" to me.</td>', 'Great colour and subject. This screams "Urban center" to me.', '2012-03-14 10:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6709739, 1004151, 138253, '<td valign="top">Looks like a parallel to a city skyline with the power station, not sure if that''s what you were going for or not... definately interesting</td>', 'Looks like a parallel to a city skyline with the power station, not sure if that''s what you were going for or not... definately interesting', '2012-03-14 10:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6709740, 1004408, 138253, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast with the focus on the residences while the business area gets "put away for the night".</td>', 'I like the contrast with the focus on the residences while the business area gets "put away for the night".', '2012-03-14 10:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
