(6709755, 1003974, 138253, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I had a similar picture taken from Museum of Civilization as my backup shot. This is definitely the skyline i was looking for. Kudos on the shot. (Taken from the trail under the Portage bridge?)</td>', 'Great shot, I had a similar picture taken from Museum of Civilization as my backup shot. This is definitely the skyline i was looking for. Kudos on the shot. (Taken from the trail under the Portage bridge?)', '2012-03-14 11:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6709758, 1004379, 138253, '<td valign="top">I Love the sky in this image! So much variance and contrast to both itself and the building!</td>', 'I Love the sky in this image! So much variance and contrast to both itself and the building!', '2012-03-14 11:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6709759, 1004387, 138253, '<td valign="top">Fantastic sense of scale in this image! I expect this to finish well.</td>', 'Fantastic sense of scale in this image! I expect this to finish well.', '2012-03-14 11:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6709762, 1004310, 138253, '<td valign="top">"The legend lives on from the Urbanites on down <br/>of the big chair they called "Barcalounger."<br/>The cushion, it is said, never gives up her bread<br/>when the skies of November turn gloomy.<br/>With a load of copper ore twenty-six pennies or more<br/>than the Barcalounger weighed empty,<br/>that good chair and true was a bone to be chewed<br/>when the "Gales of November" came early..."   :+)<br/> <br/>Seriously, great composition and texture to this shot, too bad the chair didn''t make it.</td>', '"The legend lives on from the Urbanites on down of the big chair they called "Barcalounger."The cushion, it is said, never gives up her breadwhen the skies of November turn gloomy.With a load of copper ore twenty-six pennies or morethan the Barcalounger weighed empty,that good chair and true was a bone to be chewedwhen the "Gales of November" came early..."   :+) Seriously, great composition and texture to this shot, too bad the chair didn''t make it.', '2012-03-14 11:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
