(6711342, 1002917, 138253, '<td valign="top">Sorry, i just see a grey blur, can''t tell what the original subject even is except there''s different height shadows that could possibly be buildings.<br/> <br/>---<br/> <br/>*Edit*<br/>Looking through my comments made and saw this image in a much smaller thumbnail version, got a better vantage point to the image and thought i could make out more detail. I think it''s a flower in the forground against the city skyline. If so, it worked better in the small-scale image. Increasing score a bit now that i got a better sense of what i''m looking at. Still looks like a grey blur to me in ''full size'' on the page though... just "less obscure grey blur"....</td>', 'Sorry, i just see a grey blur, can''t tell what the original subject even is except there''s different height shadows that could possibly be buildings. --- *Edit*Looking through my comments made and saw this image in a much smaller thumbnail version, got a better vantage point to the image and thought i could make out more detail. I think it''s a flower in the forground against the city skyline. If so, it worked better in the small-scale image. Increasing score a bit now that i got a better sense of what i''m looking at. Still looks like a grey blur to me in ''full size'' on the page though... just "less obscure grey blur"....', '2012-03-15 13:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
