(6711726, 1003474, 134859, '<td valign="top">Beautiful black and white.  These are the scenes I love.  I have a thing for trains, always have.  Perhaps it''s because of my oldest son.  He was fascinated by them and I would take him every day to watch the train cross the tracks (we lived within walking distance).  Ever since then, I have been interested by trains.  Beautiful shot.  Nice detail.  Love the city way off in the distance.  Just lovely!</td>', 'Beautiful black and white.  These are the scenes I love.  I have a thing for trains, always have.  Perhaps it''s because of my oldest son.  He was fascinated by them and I would take him every day to watch the train cross the tracks (we lived within walking distance).  Ever since then, I have been interested by trains.  Beautiful shot.  Nice detail.  Love the city way off in the distance.  Just lovely!', '2012-03-15 20:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6711728, 1003046, 134859, '<td valign="top">A nice shot.  Seems a little overexposed?  Im not sure.  There is also a softness that doesn''t quite work, in my opinion.  I do like the people walking, which looks like would be an amazing sight to see.  Good shot overall.</td>', 'A nice shot.  Seems a little overexposed?  Im not sure.  There is also a softness that doesn''t quite work, in my opinion.  I do like the people walking, which looks like would be an amazing sight to see.  Good shot overall.', '2012-03-15 20:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
