(6716807, 1004098, 3102, '<td valign="top">Cool vantage point, but it has a washed out appearance and feels like it should be rotated a few degrees clockwise.  The poor coloration is probably because you were shooting into the sun (which I can tell by the positioning of the shadows).<br/> <br/>I also would have given a bit more "head room" to the CN Tower so it''s not smack up against the border, too.</td>', 'Cool vantage point, but it has a washed out appearance and feels like it should be rotated a few degrees clockwise.  The poor coloration is probably because you were shooting into the sun (which I can tell by the positioning of the shadows). I also would have given a bit more "head room" to the CN Tower so it''s not smack up against the border, too.', '2012-03-19 19:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6716810, 1004094, 3102, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t strike me as meeting the challenge in any meaningful way.</td>', 'Doesn''t strike me as meeting the challenge in any meaningful way.', '2012-03-19 19:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
