(6717355, 1004358, 109363, '<td valign="top">interesting processing... it would be gaudy in another challenge, but it makes the activity of the city come out here</td>', 'interesting processing... it would be gaudy in another challenge, but it makes the activity of the city come out here', '2012-03-20 12:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
